# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day21

Compared with the past, my neighborhood has changed quite a lot.

It used to be a relatively quiet area, and there weren't many stores or restaurants nearby.

These days, there are many more cafés, restaurants, and convenience stores.

One major difference is that there are also more people walking around, especially in the evening.

I think this happened because more people have moved into the area and new buildings have been constructed.

As a result, the neighborhood has become much more convenient, although it is also a little noisier than before.

Overall, I think the changes are positive because I have more places to go and things to do nearby.
